      "en": "You discover the glitchy arcade machine in Vanellope's House and plug it in. Ralph pops out of the machine — he's been searching for Vanellope all this time! Now, he's only half back in the Valley and is stuck in a T-pose. You decide to cook him a special treat to see if that will return him to the Valley completely.",
