    {
      "key": "Secret!DreamlightValley!TheForgotten!SEC_Forg_050_Group23_StoryDescription",
      "en": "You bring Ralph a \"My Hero Cookie\" but it doesn't bring him back. Vanellope begins to panic, upset that her best friend is stuck. {character:DreamlightValley!TheForgotten} comes forward with a confession: They banished Ralph during the Forgetting, and they were frightened he would not forgive them for it. Ralph's forgiveness is instant. {character:DreamlightValley!TheForgotten} gives you a special arcade token, saved from your childhood, for the machine.",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
