      "key": "TheForgotten_011_f",
      "en": "That's just my face, right? Ha...",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_014_f",
      "en": "Forget it, okay?",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_015_f",
      "en": "Let's <Lore>search the Valley</Lore> for the arcade machine. We should <Lore>look for more of those weird cables</Lore> to show us the way.",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_012_f",
      "en": "Sure. Yeah.",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_013_f",
      "en": "I AM weird, {PlayerName}. So if I'm acting weird, that's totally normal.",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_005_f",
      "en": "I do.",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_008_f",
      "en": "I mean— <i>maybe</i> I do. Never mind. Forget I said anything.",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_006_f",
      "en": "Do you think it's—",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_009_f",
      "en": "You know what? Never mind. It's nothing.",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    }
  ],
  "WreckItRalph_TheForgotten/TheForgotten_SEC_Forg_050_SEC_Forg_050_TalkTo02.locbin": [
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_000_f",
      "en": "Was that who I think it was?",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "Player_000_choice_000_f",
      "en": "I think we're thinking the same thing! Old game, root beer...",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "Player_000_choice_001_f",
      "en": "Depends. Who do you think it was?",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "Player_000_choice_002_f",
      "en": "I think it was just your standard talking arcade game.",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_001_f",
      "en": "Yeah. Maybe...",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "Player_001_choice_000_f",
      "en": "Is there something bothering you?",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "Player_001_choice_001_f",
      "en": "We might get a friend back, but you're not excited. Why?",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "Player_001_choice_002_f",
      "en": "What's eating you?",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_005_f",
      "en": "Everyone in the Valley might not be as happy to see <i>me</i> are they are to see <i>you</i>.",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_006_f",
      "en": "Look, sorry. I'm trying to cut back on the drama. Let's just try to find the arcade machine again, okay?",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_007_f",
      "en": "If this is who we're thinking it is, we should <Lore>check Vanellope's House</Lore>.",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_002_f",
      "en": "Someone from the Valley a long time ago...",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_003_f",
      "en": "Ha. Ha. Very funny, {PlayerName}.",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_004_f",
      "en": "Though I kind of wish that was true.",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    }
  ],
  "WreckItRalph_TheForgotten/TheForgotten_SEC_Forg_050_SEC_Forg_050_TalkTo07.locbin": [
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_001_f",
      "en": "Hey, {character:DreamlightValley!TheForgotten}. Did you see that <ActivityItem>Glitchy Arcade Machine</ActivityItem> on the bridge to the Dream Castle?",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "Player_000_choice_000_f",
      "en": "It said your name.",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "Player_000_choice_001_f",
      "en": "Do you know anything about that?",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "Player_000_choice_002_f",
      "en": "Are you playing 2-player games without me?!",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_002_f",
      "en": "What?",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_000_f",
      "en": "It mentioned you and Mr. McDuck. After that, it disappeared!",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_005_f",
      "en": "Sounds weird. Maybe you should <Lore>check out Mr. McDuck's store and see if he knows anything</Lore>.",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_003_f",
      "en": "No. Or... I don't <i>think</i> I do.",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    },
    {
      "key": "TheForgotten_004_f",
      "en": "Definitely not.",
      "cz": "",
      "source": "untranslated"
    }
  ]
}